.workongoing
# Image bytes live on R2, never in git (ACCESS.md). Local syncs sit untracked.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.heic
*.dng
*.pdf
# the splits/ trees are symlinks named like images — keep them trackable
!splits/**
# non-canonical working copies must never appear here (guard CI mirrors this)
imazen-26 - Copy*/
imazen26/
nope/
*.lnk

# variant branch: the png-v3 render set is tracked here, via LFS
!png-v3/**/*.png
